          "label": "libraries",
          "path": "{prefix}/lib",
          "purpose": "Matched compiler-only shared libraries"
        },
        {
          "label": "client",
          "path": "{prefix}/share/cpg/hiprtc_adapter.py",
          "purpose": "Explicit architecture checked Python compiler API"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "ROCm release7.0.2: hip-runtime-amd7.0.51831.70002-56 and comgr3.0.0.70002-56.",
        "HIPRTC API version function reports9.0 in this vendor build; authoritative release identity is original package hashes.",
        "Only compiler libraries/headers/bitcode/docs are extracted; no GPU runtime, driver or profiler is installed.",
        "The raw HIPRTC API crashes for gfx999999 on this version. The supplied Python adapter validates against Comgr ISA enumeration first.",
        "HIPRTC LinkComplete in this upstream version requires runtime device discovery. Offline linking is performed through Comgr with explicit ISA.",
        "GPU kernel loading and execution remain untested on this host."
      ],
      "summary": "Matched standalone HIPRTC/Comgr compiler subset for explicit-target offline HIP compilation and LLVM bitcode linking."
